nction, and we have\n\n$$\ntan⁡(-x)=-tan⁡x.\n$$\n\nLet's now evaluate our expression:\n\n- Firstly, using the periodicity of $tan⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}tan⁡(-x-7\\pi ) & =tan⁡(-x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Secondly, using the oddness of $tan⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}tan⁡(-x) & =-tan⁡x \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\tan (-x - 7π)=-\\frac{9}{5}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["4ae739ec-bf10-532f-b188-9f8498b387c7"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d3697941-8007-5777-a40c-4083efb0a248" :answer/id #uuid "d3697941-8007-5777-a40c-4083efb0a248" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "911bc086-94be-5561-a621-f006bd611101" :answer/id #uuid "911bc086-94be-5561-a621-f006bd611101" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{5}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "286fc4cf-0b96-5584-9c0b-fdbe8d9d8fe7" :answer/id #uuid "286fc4cf-0b96-5584-9c0b-fdbe8d9d8fe7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "94712f0d-7669-5b34-bc7f-8564e9df9d11" :answer/id #uuid "94712f0d-7669-5b34-bc7f-8564e9df9d11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5} - 7π" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fd3299db-288a-5f5f-8ecb-2e603d91d23c" :answer/id #uuid "fd3299db-288a-5f5f-8ecb-2e603d91d23c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{5} - 7π" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "60a33238-69fc-5ac5-882d-e95da4c4963b" :answer-field/id #uuid "60a33238-69fc-5ac5-882d-e95da4c4963b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["d3697941-8007-5777-a40c-4083efb0a248" "911bc086-94be-5561-a621-f006bd611101" "286fc4cf-0b96-5584-9c0b-fdbe8d9d8fe7" "94712f0d-7669-5b34-bc7f-8564e9df9d11" "fd3299db-288a-5f5f-8ecb-2e603d91d23c"] :answer-field/correct "911bc086-94be-5561-a621-f006bd611101" :db/ensure :answer-field/validat