e82a74dde8170ad708e379caf2188873bcddc83177e87c7a6.png)\n\nFrom the graph, we note the following:\n\n- The period of $tan⁡x$ is $\\pi .$\n\n- Our graph has rotational symmetry of order $2$ about the origin. This means that $tan⁡x$ is an *odd* function, and we have\n\n$$\ntan⁡(-x)=-tan⁡x.\n$$\n\nLet's now evaluate our expression:\n\n- Firstly, using the periodicity of $tan⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}tan⁡(-x+\\pi ) & =tan⁡(-x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Secondly, using the oddness of $tan⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}tan⁡(-x) & =-tan⁡x \\\\  & =-(-7) \\\\  & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{8}tan⁡(-x+\\pi )+\\frac{3}{8} & =\\frac{7}{8}\\cdot 7+\\frac{3}{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{49}{8}+\\frac{3}{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{52}{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{13}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["65b32ad3-3562-5293-912b-f6dcacf94d48"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "ee2be17c-7ff2-5ace-8a40-875aced950b8" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186176058.py"} [:db/add 17592186176058 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186176058 :knowledge-point/questions ["68c7b09d-a6f5-532c-a961-160da57515ab" "3a223131-a445-5eaa-af96-514c74007b30" "399cc078-de71-5c47-b032-5dcccc702272" "f09b88d6-2fb6-5a40-9a66-3a39d967393d" "1383763d-65fc-5f85-a16a-c07b5229168b" "2a4929bf-d737-567f-9af5-55c791cb6e1c" "3d9809ad-44ef-540c-8012-839a65ff28c4" "8d024b2e-6668-5de9-a316-68d5087b7f9d" "90ae461d-564d-5a00-970d-e4fcb1014552" "d4e8bdc3-e66f-5636-b57f-ea5c00423763"]} [:db/ensure 17592186176058 :knowledge-point/validate]]
